Package: strawwu-disable-upstream-init
Version: __VERSION__
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: strawwu-initd,
         python3
Maintainer: StrawCoding <apt@wastebase.xyz>
Description: StrawWU disable upstream cloud-init and gnome-initial-setup
 Disables cloud-init and GNOME Initial Setup on live and installed
 systems. Purges ubuntu-desktop/ubuntu-session metas during Calamares
 chroot (W5-B4). strawwu-firstboot replaces upstream first-run UX.
